y looking one with her holding her staff, that would be great. \n\nthank you\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1H-S3eY1BNQROvGeS_oqSN3HPh-hTX4kM", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@els_mkpirro/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/03644533/uploads/origins/508d6b3e-54c4-48a0-bdd1-fedbc466dfd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87fc81baceedc9a979f1fee2fdbdf7ec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03644533/uploads/origins/508d6b3e-54c4-48a0-bdd1-fedbc466dfd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87fc81baceedc9a979f1fee2fdbdf7ec, https://si.imgix.net/03644533/uploads/origins/508d6b3e-54c4-48a0-bdd1-fedbc466dfd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d489566e0ff8f4239e372862b4cc526f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03644533/uploads/origins/508d6b3e-54c4-48a0-bdd1-fedbc466dfd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e60a898829785b9af2710fa7cd754110 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "またまたこんにちは。\n\n前回の作品では素晴らしい仕事をしてくれたので、もう一枚お願いできますか？今回は私のララとこのグリーンララが忍者として一緒にポーズをとっているもので、できれば武器を出した状態で、ポーズと背景の選択はあなた次第です。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/sWxdllW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@els_mkpirro/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1bd729ad/uploads/origins/a3c95a0d-bc0c-477a-9f83-1070dfc0b373?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7222357abcdee87767e4a5207359200", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1bd729ad/uploads/origins/a3c95a0d-bc0c-477a-9f83-1070dfc0b373?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7222357abcdee87767e4a5207359200, https://si.imgix.net/1bd729ad/uploads/origins/a3c95a0d-bc0c-477a-9f83-1070dfc0b373?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e57f179ebdf468931c5ae7bcfba7c65b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1bd729ad/uploads/origins/a3c95a0d-bc0c-4